## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be parseInt(item 2 of arguments).
Let result be "" with capacity n * 6.
Let i be 0.
While i is less than n:
    Set result to result + i + " ".
    Set i to i + 1.
Let count be 0.
Set i to 1.
While i is at most length of result:
    If item i of result equals " ":
        Set count to count + 1.
    Set i to i + 1.
Let bytes be text_bytes(result).
Let h be 0.
Repeat for b in bytes:
    Set h to (h * 31 + b) & 268435455.
Show "" + count + " " + h.
